                            <div class="s_hr pb32 pt0" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Scheidingsteken">
        <hr class="w-100 mx-auto"/>
    </div><h4><span class="base-fs">Welcome to DeNode Foundation<br/></span></h4>
    
    <p><strong><br/></strong>The DeNode Foundation supports contemporary artistic practices that originate from research, process, and transfer.</p><p>Through exhibitions, research programs, and international collaborations, the foundation provides a platform for artists whose work engages in dialogue with materiality, space, the body, narrative, and time.<br/><br/><br/>You can find us in the center of Ghent.<br/>nodenaysteen - Predikherenlei 4 - 9000 Ghent</p>
    
    </div><div class="o_colored_level col-lg-6 pt0">
                            <div class="s_hr pb32 o_colored_level pt0" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Scheidingsteken">
        <hr class="w-100 mx-auto"/>
    </div><p><span class="base-fs"><strong>during exhibitions, the nodenaysteen gallery is open:</strong></span></p><p>• from Thursday to Saturday: 2 PM - 6 PM</p><p>• Sunday: 11 AM - 5 PM</p><p><span class="base-fs">or by appointment: kristof@denode.be</span></p><div class="s_social_media o_not_editable no_icon_color text-start" data-snippet="s_social_media" data-name="Social Media">
